 "rule": "tests/hidden/selection.json (selection rule v5 sha256 7b5c8b46d3c84026acc818b559445bdf0a26f559c97337c9e69de9c705c9b172, pinned 2026-11-21T21:44:43Z): the 10 hidden sites the rule selected, in seed order, are h01..h10; the episode seed of each is its site seed (the cell derives the set-down and every noise stream from it)",
 "note": "verify.py takes the first `episodes` (grader_config.json: 10) entries; each archive's sha256 is checked before its episode. seed = the pinned episode seed; site_seed = the generator seed of the package (w4gen 0.3.0, heap library version 3: W3 with heaps on the open floor, the rubble under the slab included); candidate = its name in the selection; reference_* = the privileged reference's admission run on the same package geometry and episode seed (its final state is what the oracle reproduces bit for bit)"
}
